{"uid":"skills/sessions_watcher.py","name":"sessions_watcher.py","qualname":"skills/sessions_watcher.py","kind":"module","file":"skills/sessions_watcher.py","line":1,"end_line":440,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"LazyOwn Sessions Watcher ======================== Watchdog daemon over sessions/.","description":"When new or modified files appear, it:\n\n  scan_*.nmap (nmap text output)\n    → calls VulnBot (or local Ollama fallback) to generate sessions/plan.txt\n    → injects a PLAN_READY objective into objectives.jsonl\n    → emits PLAN_READY event to events.jsonl\n\n  scan_*.nmap.xml (nmap XML)\n    → calls FactStore.ingest_xml()\n    → emits SCAN_XML_READY event\n\n  sessions/<ip>/<port>/<tool>/*.txt  (pwntomate tool output)\n    → calls FactStore.ingest_text()\n    → emits TOOL_OUTPUT_READY event\n    → injects a factual objective: \"Review <tool> output for <ip>:<port>\"\n\n  sessions/plan.txt  (VulnBot or manual plan)\n    → emits PLAN_UPDATED event with first 500 chars as preview\n\nThis closes the OpenClaw-style loop:\n  lazynmap → watcher → plan.txt → objective injected →\n  Claude Code polls → reasons → acts → new output → watcher fires again\n\nUsage (background daemon):\n    python3 skills/sessions_watcher.py &\n\n    or via MCP:  lazyown_run_command(\"python3 skills/sessions_watcher.py &\")\n\nStop:  kill $(pgrep -f sessions_watcher.py)","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["skills/sessions_watcher.py::BASE_DIR","skills/sessions_watcher.py::SESSIONS_DIR","skills/sessions_watcher.py::SKILLS_DIR","skills/sessions_watcher.py::OLLAMA_HOST","skills/sessions_watcher.py::OLLAMA_PORT","skills/sessions_watcher.py::OLLAMA_MODEL","skills/sessions_watcher.py::POLL_INTERVAL_S","skills/sessions_watcher.py::MAX_PLAN_CHARS","skills/sessions_watcher.py::main"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
